<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>尸厥 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%B0%B8%E5%8E%A5/</link><description>Recent content in 尸厥 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 08 May 2026 09:09:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%B0%B8%E5%8E%A5/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>开治法：论关隔 论尸厥</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-27-kaizhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 08 May 2026 09:05:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-27-kaizhifa/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“开治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;关隔与尸厥&lt;/strong&gt;等气闭不开之证的治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;气闭不开而开之&lt;/strong&gt;。因气郁、邪闭所致上下不通或昏厥不语者，当以&lt;strong&gt;开郁、探吐、取嚏&lt;/strong&gt;等法急开其闭，待气机通利后再图调补。</description></item><item><title>死治法：论中邪 尸厥 论见鬼卒倒 中毒 中恶</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-14-sizhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 11:35:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-14-sizhifa/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“死治法”部分，论述&lt;strong&gt;中邪、尸厥、见鬼卒倒、中毒、中恶&lt;/strong&gt;等猝然昏厥、不省人事的急救法则。核心思想是：此类急症多因&lt;strong&gt;正气亏虚，痰迷心窍，邪气乘虚而入&lt;/strong&gt;，治当&lt;strong&gt;补正以祛邪，涌吐以开窍&lt;/strong&gt;，使患者复苏重生。</description></item></channel></rss>